              "text": "شخصیت اصلی (shakhsiyat-e asli) — \"the main character\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شخصیت اصلی این رمان یک دختر جوان است. shakhsiyat-e asli-ye in român yek dokhtar-e javân ast. The main character of this novel is a young girl."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "shakhsiyat 'character, personality' + asli 'main'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "shakhsiyat-e asli is built in Persian from two Arabic loans: shakhsiyat, from Arabic šaḫṣiyya (EtymDB), and asli, from Arabic aṣlī (EtymDB)."
            }
